OL,3,GNEWSAFund launched to back community
OL,4,Awellbeing projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has launched a new fund aimed
OL,7,Fat improving health and wellbeing in
OL,8,FJersey.
OL,10,FThe Island Health Fund will create a
OL,11,Fdedicated way for individuals,
OL,12,Ffamilies, businesses and charitable
OL,13,Ftrusts to support projects such as
OL,14,Fmedical equipment, research, clinical
OL,15,Finnovation, community health
OL,16,Finitiatives and specialist training,
OL,17,Fthe Jersey Community Foundation said.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
