OL,3,GNEWSAFund launched to back community
OL,4,Awellbeing projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive Anna Terry said: "This
OL,7,Fis not about replacing government
OL,8,Ffunding. It is about what additional
OL,9,Fphilanthropic support can make
OL,10,Fpossible."
OL,12,FAn independent panel would be set up to
OL,13,Foversee funding decisions and help
OL,14,Fshape priorities, the foundation said.
